  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desk Study - SHENZHEN PRIMARY CARE CENTER, through OMMA Healthcare, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $6,000 Desk Study reviews a proposal for a feasibility study to strengthen the capacity of basic health service units in Shenzhen City by establishing a model outpatient clinic at the Futian Community Clinic and designing a primary care curriculum for use in the training of physicians at the Dalan Community Health Service Center. Expanding primary healthcare access to China&apos;s population is a major priority for the government, and, once completed, the Futian Clinic and Dalan Community Health Service Center could serve as a model for replication across China.</narrative>
  </description>
